  "README.md.ejs": "# <%= project.artifactId %>\n\n<%_ if (agent.description) { _%>\n<%= agent.description %>\n\n<%_ } _%>\nA Spring AI agent generated by [gen-agent](https://www.npmjs.com/package/gen-agent) (profile `<%= agent.profile %>`):\nSpring Boot <%= versions.springBoot %>, Spring AI <%= versions.springAi %>, Java <%= agent.java %>.\n\n## Run\n\nJava <%= agent.java %> is the only requirement: `./mvnw` downloads Maven (checked against its SHA-256) on first use.\n\n<%_ if (!provider.apiKeyEnv) { _%>\nStart [Ollama](https://ollama.com) and pull the model (`ollama pull <%= provider.model %>`), then:\n\n<%_ } _%>\n```bash\n<%_ for (const secret of secrets) { _%>\nexport <%= secret %>=...   # never commit it\n<%_ } _%>\n./mvnw spring-boot:run\n```\n\nTalk to the agent:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s localhost:8080/api/chat -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"message\": \"Hello\"}'\n```\n\nSend back the returned `conversationId` with the next message to continue the same conversation (the last\n<%= memory.window %> messages are kept in memory).\n<%_ if (prompt.aiDisclosure) { _%>\nEvery reply carries `\"aiGenerated\": true`, so clients can tell users they are talking to an AI (EU AI Act).\n<%_ } _%>\n\n## Test\n\n```bash\n./mvnw verify\n```\n\nThe tests use a fake model: they never call <%= provider.id %> and cost nothing.\n\n## Where to put your code\n\n| Path | Owner |\n| --- | --- |\n| `src/main/resources/<%= prompt.resource %>` | yours: the system prompt |\n<%_ if (features.javaTools) { _%>\n| `src/main/java/<%= project.basePackagePath %>/tool/` | yours: the logic of your Java tools |\n<%_ } _%>\n| `src/main/java/<%= project.basePackagePath %>/generated/` | gen-agent: overwritten on regeneration, do not edit |\n| `pom.xml`, `application.yml` | shared: gen-agent will merge its changes with yours |\n<%_ if (tools.length > 0) { _%>\n\n## Tools\n\n| Tool | Kind | Implementation |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n<%_   for (const tool of tools) { _%>\n<%_     if (tool.kind === 'http') { _%>\n| `<%= tool.name %>` | HTTP `<%= tool.method %>` | `agent.tools.<%= tool.name %>.url` in `application.yml` |\n<%_     } else { _%>\n| `<%= tool.name %>` | Java | `tool/<%= tool.handlerClass %>.java` |\n<%_     } _%>\n<%_   } _%>\n<%_ } _%>\n",
  "application.yml.ejs": "spring:\n  application:\n    name: <%= project.artifactId %>\n  ai:\n    <%= provider.configKey %>:\n<%_ if (provider.apiKeyEnv) { _%>\n      api-key: ${<%= provider.apiKeyEnv %>}\n<%_ } _%>\n      chat:\n        model: <%= yamlString(provider.model) %>\n<%_ if (provider.temperature !== undefined) { _%>\n        temperature: <%= provider.temperature %>\n<%_ } _%>\n<%_ if (provider.maxTokens !== undefined) { _%>\n        <%= provider.maxTokensProperty %>: <%= provider.maxTokens %>\n<%_ } _%>\n\nagent:\n  system-prompt: classpath:<%= prompt.resource %>\n  memory:\n    window: <%= memory.window %>\n<%_ if (features.httpTools) { _%>\n  tools:\n<%_   for (const tool of tools) { _%>\n<%_     if (tool.kind === 'http') { _%>\n    <%= tool.name %>:\n      url: <%= yamlString(tool.url) %>\n<%_       if (tool.auth) { _%>\n      token: ${<%= tool.auth.env %>}\n<%_       } _%>\n      max-response-chars: <%= tool.maxResponseChars %>\n<%_     } _%>\n<%_   } _%>\n<%_ } _%>\n",
